NATURE OF THE OUTPUT

The match predictions this software produces are statistical estimates derived
from historical results. They are not advice of any kind, financial or
otherwise, and carry no guarantee of accuracy — the published accuracy figures
are historical measurements on held-out data, not a forecast of future
performance. Any use in connection with wagering is entirely at the user's own
risk.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to the Premier
League, the NFL, the NBA, ESPN, EA, or any other rights holder. Data is
retrieved from third-party sources that carry their own terms of use.
